# Walkthrough: Onboarding & Home Logic Refinement

**Date**: February 11, 2026
**Status**: Completed & Verified

## 1. Overview
We refined the onboarding experience to ensure users can transition smoothly to the Home screen, even if they choose to skip optional steps. We also introduced a "Warm Welcome" modal that appears *only* for users who have just completed the onboarding process.

## 2. Changes Implemented

### A. Triple-Helix Behavior (The Soul)
*   Created [features/onboarding_journey.feature](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/features/onboarding_journey.feature) to define the "Skip to Home" and "Welcome" behavior in Gherkin.

### B. Structural Updates (The Bone)
*   **Store ([useStore.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/store/useStore.ts))**: Added `justFinishedOnboarding` flag to track the "fresh" state of a user.
*   **Types ([User.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/types/User.ts))**: Added `onboarding_completed` field to match the Supabase schema.
*   **Onboarding ([OnboardingScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/OnboardingScreen.tsx))**:
    *   Changed "Skip" button behavior to call [handleComplete()](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/OnboardingScreen.tsx#306-338) immediately, skipping all remaining slides.
    *   Fixed Accessibility/Linting implicit `any` errors.
*   **App Logic ([App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/App.tsx))**:
    *   Keyed the `justFinishedOnboarding` flag to true when `onComplete` is triggered.
*   **Home Screen Views ([StudentSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/StudentSelfView.tsx), [TeacherSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/TeacherSelfView.tsx), [PrincipalSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/PrincipalSelfView.tsx), [FounderSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/FounderSelfView.tsx), [AdminSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/AdminSelfView.tsx))**:
    *   Implemented `<WelcomeModal />` integration in all five role-specific views.
    *   Modal appears if `justFinishedOnboarding` is true.
    *   Dismissing modal sets flag to false.

### C. Components
*   **New**: [src/components/self/WelcomeModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/self/WelcomeModal.tsx) - A reusable modal component for the welcome message.

